Measure how well mxr sorts mail: today's classifier against labelled scenarios

Usage: mxr classify [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  eval  Grade the mail already in this mailbox against labelled scenarios: per question (who sent it, which mode it goes to, whether it makes a to-do, whether it makes a record) how often today's rules agree, and every email they get wrong. Read-only and local. Run `mxr demo` first to get mail with labels
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
